# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository and on checkout.
# Prettier expects LF (`endOfLine` default); without this, Windows
# checkouts under core.autocrlf=true produce CRLF working-tree files and
# `npm run format:check` flags the entire repo (issue #117).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicit binary markers — anything added later that must not be touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.pak binary
*.asar binary
*.bin binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
